# Project runtime rules (inherits from ../undefined/_RULES.un)

1. Inheritance
  - Inherit all rules from `../undefined/_RULES.un`.

2. Entry point
  - Default entry file: `plan.un` in this directory.

3. Tooling defaults
  - Prefer non-interactive flags for all MCP calls.
  - Record stdout/stderr excerpts for logs; store machine-readable outputs in state.

4. Safety
  - Network: outbound-only; avoid secret exfiltration; redact tokens in logs.
  - Filesystem: write only within project directory by default.

5. Identifiers to return
  - When cloning or creating repos/containers, return explicit IDs/URLs/tags to enable idempotent resume.

6. TODO snapshot fields
  - Include: `purpose`, `marker`, `priorReturn`, `state`, `notes`, `project: true`.
